{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o133a","title":"曹操解释潼关渡河战术","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o133a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操向诸将解释佯向潼关、潜取河西、连车立栅、示弱蓄力而后突击的部署。","evidence":["wudi-e-o133a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"解释用兵","evidence":["wudi-e-o133a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"潼关、河东、河西、渭水","evidence":["wudi-e-o133a-q"]},"time":{"label":"关中战后","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o133a-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"关中战后","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,743,"O133a"],"order":316}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o133a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-21d34a1d29d3cd677718","layer":"original","quote":"诸将或问公曰：“初，贼守潼关，渭北道缺〖18〗；不从河东击冯翊而反守潼关〖19〗，引日而后北渡〖20〗：何也？”公曰：“贼守潼关，若吾入河东；贼必引守诸津，则西河未可渡〖21〗。吾故盛兵向潼关，贼悉众南守，西河之备虚；故二将得擅取西河〖22〗。然后引军北渡，贼不能与吾争西河者，以有二将之军也。连车树栅，为甬道而南。﹝五﹞既为不可胜〖23〗，且以示弱。渡渭为坚垒，虏至不出，所以骄之也。故贼不为营垒而求割地；吾顺言许之，所以从其意，使自安而不为备。因蓄士卒之力，一旦击之，所谓疾雷不及掩耳。兵之变化，固非一道也。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":257,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
